(My maternal grandfather Isa\054 may Allah\054 Exalted\054 have mercy on him\054 was) Tj
T*
(among the people of the mosques in his prayers\056 He would speak perhaps) Tj
T*
(10 sentences in a day\073 he spoke very little\056 He was not a tyrant on earth\054) Tj
T*
(nor arrogant\054 nor difficult\073 he was gentle and easygoing in nearly 99\045 of) Tj
T*
(his states\056 But he was afflicted with smoking until his death\054 and he was a) Tj
T*
(heavy smoker\056 His death was a psychological shock for me\054 not because) Tj
T*
(of my attachment to him\054 may Allah\054 Exalted\054 have mercy on him\054 but) Tj
T*
(because of the scene of his death\054 which I ask Allah the Mighty\054 our Lord\054) Tj
T*
(to make an expiation for his sins\054 for he died in very severe pain because) Tj
T*
(of smoking\054 and they found that his bed) Tj
